entries[208222] = { ["name"] = "Old Guard Retaliator", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique\nTwo-Hand Axe\n163 - 245 Damage Speed 3.90\n(52.31 damage per second)\n+8 Strength\n+10 Agility\n+41 Stamina\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Warrior\nRequires Level 55\nEquip: On landing a killing blow that grants experience or honor, your next attack will critically strike.\n\"The previous owner immaculately cared for this weapon.\"\nSell Price:" }
